{%- comment -%}
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  SECTION: LUXURY CATEGORY REEL (ADAPTIVE DYNAMIC ARCHITECTURE - ZERO MOCK)
  - 100% Real Shopify Data (Zero fake products / Zero hardcoded mock text)
  - Adaptive Dynamic Layout based on product count (prod_count = col.products.size):
      * prod_count == 1: Horizontal Spotlight (55% hero imagery left, 45% specification details + Inquire CTA right). Card fills 100% container width, hides progress bar & navigation arrows.
      * prod_count == 2 or 3: Evenly spaced CSS Grid (cols-2 or cols-3), cards expand to fill 100% container width with zero right-hand void.
      * prod_count >= 4: Full horizontal Carousel reel with gold progress indicator and circular navigation controls.
      * prod_count == 0: Refined editorial empty state.
  - Single-line horizontal Tab Ribbon with instantaneous tab transition.
  - Self-contained CSS & Vanilla JS (Zero external CDN).
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  #LuxuryCategoryReel-{{ section.id }},
  #LuxuryCategoryReel-{{ section.id }} * {
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
  }

  #LuxuryCategoryReel-{{ section.id }} {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color | default: '#FCFAF8' }};
    padding: {{ section.settings.padding_top | default: 64 }}px 0 {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | default: 72 }}px;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .lcr-container {
    max-width: {{ section.settings.container_max_width | default: 1360 }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .lcr-container {
      padding: 0 32px;
    }
  }

  /* Section Header */
  .lcr-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .lcr-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
